  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.10 - HTML Tag Case-Sensitivity Fix (January 2026)\n- FIX: HTML lowercase tags like section, data, nav are now preserved as-is\n- Template tags MUST be PascalCase (Section, Data, Nav, Element, Block, etc.)\n- This allows section wrapper around Data component without issues\n- Example: section class=\"x\" with Data component=\"slider\" inside now works\n\nv1.0.9 - Security Path Auto-Registration (January 2026)\n- FIX: SetComponentsDirectory/SetPagesDirectory now auto-registers paths for security validation\n- Paths with spaces now work correctly\n- No more \"Template path failed security validation\" errors\n\nv1.0.8 - Pages Directory Support\n- SetPagesDirectory() - Configure separate directory for page templates\n- RenderPage() - Render page templates directly\n- RenderFile(path, isPage) - Flag to choose between components/pages directory\n\nv1.0.7 - Type-Specific Component Tags\n- Type-Specific Tags - Element, Block, Data, Nav with auto path prefix\n- OnAfterIncludeRender callback - fires after component renders for wrapping\n- ComponentType property in IncludeInfo\n\nv1.0.6 - OnBeforeIncludeRender Event\nv1.0.5 - Pre-Render Data Extraction\nv1.0.0 - Initial Release",
